    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The Goods and Services Tax (GST) e-Way bill is a mandatory document required for the transportation of goods worth over Rs. 50,000. This electronic document is generated online and must accompany the goods during transit. It helps in tracking the movement of goods and ensures compliance with tax regulations.</p>
